    n<// SYNTHETIC PIC 2.0                                          4/23/98> u<7978> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7979> l<1024:1> el<1024:70>
    n<//> u<7979> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7980> l<1025:1> el<1025:3>
    n<//    This is a synthesizable Microchip 16C57 compatible> u<7980> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7981> l<1026:1> el<1026:57>
    n<//    microcontroller.  This core is not intended as a high fidelity model of> u<7981> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7982> l<1027:1> el<1027:78>
    n<//    the PIC, but simply a way to offer a simple processor core to people> u<7982> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7983> l<1028:1> el<1028:75>
    n<//    familiar with the PIC who also have PIC tools.  > u<7983> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7984> l<1029:1> el<1029:55>
    n<//> u<7984> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7985> l<1030:1> el<1030:3>
    n<//    pictest.v  -   top-level testbench (NOT SYNTHESIZABLE)> u<7985> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7986> l<1031:1> el<1031:61>
    n<//    piccpu.v   -   top-level synthesizable module> u<7986> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7987> l<1032:1> el<1032:52>
    n<//    picregs.v  -   register file instantiated under piccpu> u<7987> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7988> l<1033:1> el<1033:61>
    n<//    picalu.v   -   ALU instantiated under piccpu> u<7988> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7989> l<1034:1> el<1034:51>
