    n<//                   into the Verilog $readmemh compatible file> u<7991> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7992> l<1037:1> el<1037:64>
    n<//    test*.asm  -   (note the wildcard..) Several test programs used> u<7992> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7993> l<1038:1> el<1038:70>
    n<//                   to help debug the verilog.  I used MPLAB and the simulator> u<7993> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7994> l<1039:1> el<1039:80>
    n<//                   to develop these programs and get the expected results.> u<7994> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<20732> s<7995> l<1040:1> el<1040:77>
